tion with others.</p></div><div class="ethne-step-images"><a href="/images/voca/ethne/step-6.jpeg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open screenshot: Share the app"><img :src="'/images/voca/ethne/step-6.jpeg'" alt="Ethne app screenshot: Share the app" loading="lazy"></a></div></li><li class="ethne-step"><div class="ethne-step-copy"><h3>Choose the APK option</h3><p>For the Android app-sharing method shown in the guide, choose “APK”. Once installed on recipients’ devices, they should open the app and go to “Share”.</p></div><div class="ethne-step-images"><a href="/images/voca/ethne/step-7.jpeg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open screenshot: Choose the APK option"><img :src="'/images/voca/ethne/step-7.jpeg'" alt="Ethne app screenshot: Choose the APK option" loading="lazy"></a></div></li><li class="ethne-step"><div class="ethne-step-copy"><h3>Start or join a Sharing Circle</h3><p>Host: start a Sharing Circle to share content. Recipients: join the Sharing Circle by scanning the host’s barcode.</p></div><div class="ethne-step-images"><a href="/images/voca/ethne/step-8.jpeg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open screenshot: Start or join a Sharing Circle"><img :src="'/images/voca/ethne/step-8.jpeg'" alt="Ethne app screenshot: Start or join a Sharing Circle" loading="lazy"></a><a href="/images/voca/ethne/step-9.jpeg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open screenshot: Start or join a Sharing Circle"><img :src="'/images/voca/ethne/step-9.jpeg'" alt="Ethne app screenshot: Start or join a Sharing Circle" loading="lazy"></a></div></li><li class="ethne-step"><div class="ethne-step-copy"><h3>Accept the request</h3><p>The host accepts the recipient’s request to join the Sharing Circle.</p></div><div class="ethne-step-images"><a href="/images/voca/ethne/step-10.jpeg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open screenshot: Accept the request"><img :src="'/images/voca/ethne/step-10.jpeg'" alt="Ethne app screenshot: Accept the request" loadi